  {
    "name": "read",
    "description": "Read a file with line numbers and pagination. Rejects binary files. Pass `project` (UUID or owner/repo slug) to read a file from ANOTHER registered repo — served read-only from its default branch (no checkout); omit it to read your task worktree.",
